@tibia.sh/tibiawiki-data contains two works under two licences: the TibiaWiki
index (index.db), under CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported, and the JavaScript module that
locates it (dist/), under MIT.


1. The index: index.db
======================

index.db is an adaptation of text from TibiaWiki (https://tibia.fandom.com),
written by TibiaWiki and its contributors. Its content comes from wiki pages,
each found at https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/ followed by the page title with
spaces replaced by underscores. A page's history credits its authors.

TibiaWiki licenses its text under Fandom's licensing terms
(https://www.fandom.com/licensing): Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0). Its own copyright page is
https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/TibiaWiki:Copyrights. This adaptation is released
under the same licence, CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

What was changed: the wiki's page wikitext was parsed into SQLite tables by
tibiawiki-sql. Derived data was then added: creature ability area grids, spell
area shapes decoded from the wiki's own animations, and links to the wiki's
images. The images themselves are not included.

Tibia and its game content are copyright CipSoft GmbH. Those rights are not
TibiaWiki's to license, and nothing in this package licenses them.

The index is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.


